State of New York. County of Jefferson }
Be it Known that before me Affice Fox a Justice of the Peace duly authorized by law to administer oaths in and for the county aforesaid, personally appeared Abigail Pyons and made oath in due form of law that she is the identical person named in the certificate of Pension herewith annexed - that she has not intermarried but con- tinues the widow of Jacob Pyon & that she now resides in Depauille Jefferson Co N.Y. & has resided there for the space of one and 1/2 years past, and that previous thereto she resided in Lyme Jeff co that her present Pension is at the rate of seventy dollars per annum & that she claims & believes herself to be entitled to an increase of the same to sum of ninety six dollars per annum from & after the date of the original granting of said certificate for & during her lifetime to the present date & that she should hereafter be placed upon the pensions rolls & receive a pension at the rate of ninety six dollars per annum as she believes herself by law entitled to. -
A. Fox Justice of the Peace

